/-!
# Kissat Fidelity BVE Parity Proofs — Shared Tactics & Helpers (`FidBveTactics`)

Exports shared `@[scoped bv_c0]` lemmas, `fid_norm_ofnat` (normalizing nested `OfNat.ofNat`
terms generated by C0 lowering back to canonical `Nat` literals), `fid_ne`, `fid_omega`,
`fid_call`, and `FullState.LengthsOk` frame wrappers (`0` `@[expose]`, `std3`).
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

